```python
detected_objects : { 'baseball': [{'bbox': [[34, 50, 200, 220], 'T', 0.92], 'outputpath': 'detected_objects/baseball_1.png'}], 'basket': [{'bbox': [220, 100, 400, 350], 'T', 0.85], 'outputpath': 'detected_objects/basket_1.png'}]
